{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n こんばんは\n \n \n 今日も１日お疲れ様です。\n \n \n 昨日と今日と2日間は、\n 個別のオンラインミート＆グリートでした‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n 皆さんの休日のちょっとした時間であっても\n 画面を通して会いに来て下さることが\n とても嬉しいです。\n \n \n いつも会いに来て下さり\n ありがとうございます。\n \n \n 最近はクイズやモノマネ、\n お手紙を書いて直接読んでくださる方や\n イラストを描いてくださる方など\n 私の為にわざわざ準備して下さっていたり、\n \n \n 皆さんのペットを見せていただけたり\n 凄く楽しく、癒され、幸せな気持ちになります😳\n \n \n この限られた時間で\n 私ばかりが楽しませていただいていて\n 私は何か皆さんに届けられているのか\n 不安になることもたくさんありますが、\n \n \n 皆さんにとっての癒しだったり、\n 糧になれたらいいな、と思います。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKK6HJFWXSBFDVGZ8HQV6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKM7P1NJ2060HBKM0ZVH4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ハーフアップ。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKN6FKED94T9B99YYSVCW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKPARDVG1H8F4E8NTCBT6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 編み込み。\n \n \n この髪型が皆さんから好評で嬉しかったです‪‪☺︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKQAQ572JQSTXAK8YWR2R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 兵庫姉妹‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n きらちゃんといのりが\n 可愛い言い合いしてる姿が\n 微笑ましく感じてしまいます。\n \n \n 本当に妹が出来たような気持ちになる。😊\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKRBRW57SJ3V7DKHCSZY5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKSBCBJFQBJGQQ2WJ09AE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n あお、お誕生日おめでとう🦖\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKTB1E1GEPTRH4SGXVX6B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKVB6HT422Z9H7WK155DW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKWC7M9D8H36HEBRT49Q7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KKXAQSRBJQZ1BFM57E2JK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ステー期。\n \n \n 昨日のミーグリの写真は、\n また今度載せますね‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n おやすみなさい。\n \n \n みい。             "}],"source":"archive"}